      "writtenOn": "2025-02-12T09:24:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From discussion: This still won\u0027t work for the start/stop/start case. Any link layer event that happens after the 2nd start will affect the 2nd start request, even if it was meant for the first start/stop/\n\nCase 1) Already serving\n1) Stop -- remove request from list\n2) Start -- add request to list\n3) Link layer goes down -- remove request\n4) Link layer goes up -- no request anymore (bug)\n\nCase 2) No requests yet\n1) Start -- add request to list\n2) Stop -- remove request from list\n3) Start -- add request to list\n4) Link layer goes up -- start IP serving with request\n5) Link layer goes down -- stop IP serving --\u003e remove request\n6) Link layer goes up -- no request anymore (bug)",
